{"id":"666876","name":"雪菜冬瓜汤","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666876/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪菜","amount":"60g"},{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜雪菜。","img":"images/666876/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"择好备用。","img":"images/666876/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"雪里蕻洗净。","img":"images/666876/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/666876/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将冬瓜洗净，去皮，去瓤，切成3厘米长，0.5厘米厚，2厘米宽的块。","img":"images/666876/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅置火上，倒入适量水烧开，放冬瓜块，烧开后撇去浮沫，盖上锅盖煮10分钟左右。","img":"images/666876/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入雪里蕻。","img":"images/666876/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开，加入盐调味，淋入香油即可。","img":"images/666876/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盛入碗中。","img":"images/666876/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"清淡可口。","img":"images/666876/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}